= Papers

The following is a list of my selected peer-reviewed publications. All articles, abstracts, and book chapters can be found at #link("https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=IcwW-WAAAAAJ&hl=en")[Google Scholar]. I am also can be found at #link("https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4144-8402")[ORCID] and #link("https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/O-9599-2017")[WoS].

stats as of 07 November 2024: 54 scientific papers, \~254 citations, h-index: 9. These citation statistics are a static snapshot and are not refreshed during site builds.

